#. Additional context for a source testimonial on the homepage
#: lib/cameroon-directory.ts:1088
msgid "In banking and finance, screening hundreds of unverified email attachments wastes dozens of recruitment hours every semester. MANTECH's structured filtering allowed us to shortlist 15 outstanding fintech interns across 4 regions in under a week."
