msgid "The Intern Passport is your cryptographically identifiable professional discovery credential on MANTECH Nexus. Each passport receives a unique verification identifier (e.g. MN-LT-2026-XXXX). Verified host enterprises and universities can inspect validated competencies, academic achievements, and authorized credentials with strict zero-trust privacy controls."
